 project and join us for a night of crafting and fun. Whether you’re knitting, crocheting, sewing, bring your work-in-progress and get ready for a cosy evening with an excellent movie. A collaboration between Coldharbour Blue and Craft Forward.</p>\n</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-c-small-cta tribe-common-b3 tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-cost\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-c-small-cta__price\">\n\t\t&pound;10.00\t</span>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n</article>\n\n\t</div>\n\n\t\n</div>\n</td>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<td\n\t class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day tribe-events-calendar-month__day--past tribe-events-calendar-month__day--other-month tribe-events-calendar-month__day--past-month\" \taria-labelledby=\"tribe-events-calendar-day-2026-07-30\"\n\tdata-js=\"tribe-events-month-grid-cell\"\n>\n\t<button\n\taria-expanded=\"false\"\n\taria-controls=\"tribe-events-calendar-mobile-day-2026-07-30\"\n\taria-label=\"July 30, 0 events, past day\"\n\t class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day-cell tribe-events-calendar-month__day-cell--mobile\" \tdata-js=\"tribe-events-calendar-month-day-cell-mobile\"\n>\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day-date tribe-common-h6 tribe-common-h--alt\">\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-common-a11y-visual-hide\">\n\t\t\t0 events\t\t</span>\n\t\t<time\n\t\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day-date-daynum\"\n\t\t\tdatetime=\"2026-07-30\"\n\t\t>\n\t\t\t30\t\t</time>\n\t</div>\n\t\n</button>\n\t\n<div\n\tid=\"tribe-events-calendar-day-2026-07-30\"\n\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day-cell tribe-events-calendar-month__day-cell--desktop tribe-common-a11y-hidden\"\n>\n\t\n<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day-date tribe-common-h4\">\n\t<span class=\"tribe-common-a11y-visual-hide\">\n\t\t0 events,\n\t</span>\n\t<time\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day-date-daynum\"\n\t\tdatetime=\"2026-07-30\"\n\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t30\t\t\t</time>\n</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-m