endar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-template tribe-common-a11y-hidden\">\n\t<div\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip\"\n\t\tid=\"tribe-events-tooltip-content-16112\"\n\t\trole=\"tooltip\"\n\t>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-featured-image-wrapper\">\n\t<img\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-featured-image\"\n\t\tsrc=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/cz4hpiwpx1at7osaidr0.webp\"\n\t\t\t\t\tsrcset=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/cz4hpiwpx1at7osaidr0-300x300.webp 300w, https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/cz4hpiwpx1at7osaidr0-150x150.webp 150w, https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/cz4hpiwpx1at7osaidr0-600x600.webp 600w, https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/cz4hpiwpx1at7osaidr0-100x100.webp 100w, https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/cz4hpiwpx1at7osaidr0.webp 750w\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\talt=\"\"\n\t\t\t/>\n</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-datetime\">\n\t\t<time datetime=\"2026-08-02\">\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">August 2 @ 1:00 pm</span> - <span class=\"tribe-event-time\">4:00 pm</span>\t</time>\n\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-title tribe-common-h7\">\n\t<a\n\t\thref=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/event/the-film-club-death-becomes-her-1992/\"\n\t\ttitle=\"The Film Club &#8211; &#8216;Death Becomes Her&#8217; (1992)\"\n\t\trel=\"bookmark\"\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-title-link tribe-common-anchor-thin\"\n\t>\n\t\tThe Film Club &#8211; &#8216;Death Becomes Her&#8217; (1992)\t</a>\n</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-description tribe-common-b3\">\n\t<p>Join us for a special screening of Death Becomes Her (1992), the iconic dark comedy. Funny, sharp, and endlessly quotable, it's a celebration of camp cinema and the pressures of beauty, ageing, and perfection. We'll also be celebrating the film's recent return to pop culture, including its influence on Sabrina Carpenter's latest music video, with [&hellip;]</p>\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n</article>\n\n\t\n\t\n<article  class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event post-15543 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry tribe_events_cat-screenings cat_screenings\" >\n\n\t\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-details\">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-datetime\">\n\t\t<time datetime=\"17:00\">\n\t\t5:00 pm\t</time>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-datetime-separator\"> - </span>\n\t\t<time datetime=\"19:00\">\n\t\t\t7:00 pm\t\t</time>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-title tribe-common-h8 tribe-common-h--alt\">\n\t<a\n\t\thref=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/event/the-last-one-for-the-road-2/\"\n\t\ttitle=\"The Last One for the Road\"\n\t\trel=\"bookmark\"\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-title-link tribe-common-anchor-thin\"\n\t\tdata-js=\"tribe-events-tooltip\"\n\t\tdata-tooltip-content=\"#tribe-events-tooltip-content-15543\"\n\t\taria-describedby=\"tribe-events-tooltip-content-15543\"\n\t>\n\t\tThe Last One for the Road\t</a>\n</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-template tribe-common-a11y-hidden\">\n\t<div\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip\"\n\t\tid=\"tribe-events-tooltip-content-15543\"\n\t\trole=\"tooltip\"\n\t>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-featured-image-wrapper\">\n\t<img\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-featured-image\"\n\t\tsrc=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/last.webp\"\n\t\t\t\t\tsrcs