lue.com/event/the-christophers-2/\"\n\t\ttitle=\"The Christophers\"\n\t\trel=\"bookmark\"\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-title-link tribe-common-anchor-thin\"\n\t\tdata-js=\"tribe-events-tooltip\"\n\t\tdata-tooltip-content=\"#tribe-events-tooltip-content-16142\"\n\t\taria-describedby=\"tribe-events-tooltip-content-16142\"\n\t>\n\t\tThe Christophers\t</a>\n</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-template tribe-common-a11y-hidden\">\n\t<div\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip\"\n\t\tid=\"tribe-events-tooltip-content-16142\"\n\t\trole=\"tooltip\"\n\t>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-featured-image-wrapper\">\n\t<img\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-featured-image\"\n\t\tsrc=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/chris.webp\"\n\t\t\t\t\tsrcset=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/chris-300x169.webp 300w, https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/chris-1024x576.webp 1024w, https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/chris-768x432.webp 768w, https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/chris-600x338.webp 600w, https://www.coldharbourblue.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/chris.webp 1066w\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\talt=\"\"\n\t\t\t/>\n</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-datetime\">\n\t\t<time datetime=\"2026-08-23\">\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">August 23 @ 5:00 pm</span> - <span class=\"tribe-event-time\">7:00 pm</span>\t</time>\n\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-title tribe-common-h7\">\n\t<a\n\t\thref=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/event/the-christophers-2/\"\n\t\ttitle=\"The Christophers\"\n\t\trel=\"bookmark\"\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-title-link tribe-common-anchor-thin\"\n\t>\n\t\tThe Christophers\t</a>\n</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-description tribe-common-b3\">\n\t<p>The estranged children of a once-famous artist hire a forger to complete his unfinished works so they can be \"discovered\" and sold after his death.</p>\n</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-c-small-cta tribe-common-b3 tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-cost\">\n\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\thref=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/event/the-christophers-2/#tribe-tickets__tickets-form\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-c-small-cta__link tribe-common-cta tribe-common-cta--thin-alt\"\n\t\t>\n\t\t\tGet Tickets\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-c-small-cta__price\">\n\t\t&pound;10.00\t</span>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n</article>\n\n\t</div>\n\n\t\n</div>\n</td>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__week\" data-js=\"tribe-events-month-grid-row\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<td\n\t class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day\" \taria-labelledby=\"tribe-events-calendar-day-2026-08-24\"\n\tdata-js=\"tribe-events-month-grid-cell\"\n>\n\t<button\n\taria-expanded=\"false\"\n\taria-controls=\"tribe-events-calendar-mobile-day-2026-08-24\"\n\taria-label=\"August 24, 0 events, upcoming day\"\n\t class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day-cell tribe-events-calendar-month__day-cell--mobile\" \tdata-js=\"tribe-events-calendar-month-day-cell-mobile\"\n>\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day-date tribe-common-h6 tribe-common-h--alt\">\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-common-a11y-visual-hide\">\n\t\t\t0 events\t\t</span>\n\t\t<time\n\t\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day-date-daynum\"\n\t\t\tdatetime=\"2026-08-24\"\n\t\t>\n\t\t\t24\t\t</time>\n\t</div>\n\t\n</button>\n\t\n<div\n\tid=\"tribe-events-calendar-day-2026-08-24\"\n\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day-cell tribe-events-calendar-month__day-cell--desktop tribe-common-a11y-hidden\"\n>\n\t\n<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day-date tribe-comm