\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-description tribe-common-b3\">\n\t<p>In the late 1990s, Gavin Bain and Billy Boyd had their musical ambitions consistently ridiculed for having the 'wrong' accents, so they went for broke and reinvented themselves as Californian rappers. The duo re-recorded their own tracks with fake accents and turned up in London claiming to be an established duo on the Cali scene [&hellip;]</p>\n</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-c-small-cta tribe-common-b3 tribe-events-calendar-month__calendar-event-tooltip-cost\">\n\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\thref=\"https://www.coldharbourblue.com/event/california-scheming-2/#tribe-tickets__tickets-form\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-c-small-cta__link tribe-common-cta tribe-common-cta--thin-alt\"\n\t\t>\n\t\t\tGet Tickets\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"tribe-events-c-small-cta__price\">\n\t\t&pound;10.00\t</span>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n</article>\n\n\t</div>\n\n\t\n</div>\n</td>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t<tr class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__week\" data-js=\"tribe-events-month-grid-row\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<td\n\t class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day\" \taria-labelledby=\"tribe-events-calendar-day-2026-08-31\"\n\tdata-js=\"tribe-events-month-grid-cell\"\n>\n\t<button\n\taria-expanded=\"false\"\n\taria-controls=\"tribe-events-calendar-mobile-day-2026-08-31\"\n\taria-label=\"August 31, 0 events, upcoming day\"\n\t class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day-cell tribe-events-calendar-month__day-cell--mobile\" \tdata-js=\"tribe-events-calendar-month-day-cell-mobile\"\n>\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day-date tribe-common-h6 tribe-common-h--alt\">\n\t\t<span class=\"tribe-common-a11y-visual-hide\">\n\t\t\t0 events\t\t</span>\n\t\t<time\n\t\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-month__day-date-daynum\"\n\t\t\tdatetime=\"2026-08-31\"\n\t\t>\n\t\t\t31\t\t</time>\n\t</div>\n\t\n</button>\n\t\n<div\n\tid=\"tribe-events-calendar-day-2026-08-31\"\n\tclass=\"tribe-events-